798
00:58:19,750 --> 00:58:22,457
That's not it, babe.

799
00:58:22,458 --> 00:58:25,957
Softly, like a wave...

800
00:58:25,958 --> 00:58:29,749
Hi! For those just joining,
welcome to the class!

801
00:58:29,750 --> 00:58:33,040
Please, take any empty spots.

802
00:58:33,041 --> 00:58:36,791
I'm Novilham. Call me Ilham or Novi.

803
00:58:38,958 --> 00:58:41,624
Let's learn some choreography!

804
00:58:41,625 --> 00:58:44,207
Look at me carefully.
I don't want to repeat myself.

805
00:58:44,208 --> 00:58:45,082
Pay attention, okay?

806
00:58:45,083 --> 00:58:47,915
One, right hand up, left hand up.

807
00:58:47,916 --> 00:58:50,665
Crown, then shampoo, and body soap.

808
00:58:50,666 --> 00:58:55,665
Left tit, right tit, go down,
period cramps, and turn!

809
00:58:55,666 --> 00:58:57,040
Period cramps, and turn!

810
00:58:57,041 --> 00:58:59,374
Go big, then close, go big, then close!

811
00:58:59,375 --> 00:59:06,332
One more, then go down, go up,
shampoo, flip it, turn back.

812
00:59:06,333 --> 00:59:09,875
Twerk, twerk, twerk all the way, go up,
and turn around.

813
00:59:12,583 --> 00:59:13,541
Understood?

814
00:59:14,125 --> 00:59:16,082
Now quick, follow me!

815
00:59:16,083 --> 00:59:17,124
Let's do it together!

816
00:59:17,125 --> 00:59:19,915
Right hand up, left hand up,

817
00:59:19,916 --> 00:59:24,707
crown, then shampoo, and soap.

818
00:59:24,708 --> 00:59:30,124
Left tit, right tit, go down,
period cramps, and turn!

819
00:59:30,125 --> 00:59:31,040
Bang!

820
00:59:31,041 --> 00:59:33,249
Period cramps and turn!

821
00:59:33,250 --> 00:59:36,332
Go big, then close, go big, then close!

822
00:59:36,333 --> 00:59:42,957
One more, then go down, go up,
wash your transparent hair, flip it,

823
00:59:42,958 --> 00:59:47,374
turn back, twerk all the way down,
then go up,

824
00:59:47,375 --> 00:59:48,291
and turn around!

825
00:59:49,708 --> 00:59:53,040
You're not synced at all,
moves are different!

826
00:59:53,041 --> 00:59:55,375
Again from the top! Watch me!

827
00:59:55,833 --> 00:59:57,374
Put one hand up.

828
00:59:57,375 --> 00:59:58,290
Up.

829
00:59:58,291 --> 01:00:01,957
I heard you can see auras.
- Who told you that?

830
01:00:01,958 --> 01:00:04,040
Left tit, right tit.

831
01:00:04,041 --> 01:00:05,208
What's my aura?

832
01:00:05,916 --> 01:00:07,999
You can only see it in the dark?
- Yeah.

833
01:00:08,000 --> 01:00:08,958
Hold on.

834
01:00:09,666 --> 01:00:11,582
Period cramp and pose.

835
01:00:11,583 --> 01:00:13,083
Well? Am I safe?

836
01:00:13,708 --> 01:00:15,290
Murky green! Safe!

837
01:00:15,291 --> 01:00:17,458
One more time, go big!

838
01:00:18,250 --> 01:00:19,290
Six, am I safe?

839
01:00:19,291 --> 01:00:21,832
Shampoo, flip your hair!

840
01:00:21,833 --> 01:00:23,582
You too.

841
01:00:23,583 --> 01:00:26,415
Twerk all the way down and go back up.

842
01:00:26,416 --> 01:00:28,124
All of you are green, safe!

843
01:00:28,125 --> 01:00:30,874
Hey! What are you doing in the dark?

844
01:00:30,875 --> 01:00:32,290
Join the group!

845
