You guys just don't appreciate my class.

846
01:00:36,333 --> 01:00:37,375
I'm tired!

847
01:00:39,125 --> 01:00:40,415
All of you get out!

848
01:00:40,416 --> 01:00:41,749
What a waste of my energy.

849
01:00:41,750 --> 01:00:42,958
Get out!

850
01:00:43,416 --> 01:00:47,082
I'm exhausted! This is not the day.

851
01:00:47,083 --> 01:00:49,333
Quick, get out!

852
01:01:08,041 --> 01:01:11,540
I'm worried. Novilham seems so upset.

853
01:01:11,541 --> 01:01:14,041
