He should be safe, right?

854
01:01:15,000 --> 01:01:16,291
That's true...

855
01:01:35,833 --> 01:01:38,082
Why's he so down anyway?

856
01:01:38,083 --> 01:01:42,749
His dance studio was demolished
for a political party headquarters.

857
01:01:42,750 --> 01:01:46,500
Too many parties already, aren't there?
Like floating turds.

858
01:01:47,458 --> 01:01:50,875
Have you actually seen floating turds?
I haven't.

859
01:01:51,833 --> 01:01:53,124
Ever gone looking for them?

860
01:01:53,125 --> 01:01:54,125
No.

861
01:01:54,500 --> 01:01:55,790
For political parties?

862
01:01:55,791 --> 01:01:56,707
No.

863
01:01:56,708 --> 01:01:58,500
See? They're the same thing.

864
01:02:09,000 --> 01:02:11,791
Hopefully, his dancing
keeps his aura safe.

865
01:02:20,458 --> 01:02:22,790
What if he dances in anger?

866
01:02:22,791 --> 01:02:25,083
Is that even possible? Dancing angrily?

867
01:02:25,625 --> 01:02:29,291
Of course, it is.
People pray in anger all the time.

868
01:03:37,666 --> 01:03:40,249
Academic advisor...

869
01:03:40,250 --> 01:03:41,915
