870
01:03:41,916 --> 01:03:44,166
Trying to dance instead.
The Quran is hard, man.

871
01:03:46,458 --> 01:03:47,957
First time reciting?

872
01:03:47,958 --> 01:03:49,499
Yeah. We're Christians.

873
01:03:49,500 --> 01:03:51,624
Don't go in yet.
The teacher needs time alone.

874
01:03:51,625 --> 01:03:53,166
Don't tell me what to do.

875
01:04:21,625 --> 01:04:22,374
Fuck!

876
01:04:22,375 --> 01:04:24,332
We were only a few meters away!

877
01:04:24,333 --> 01:04:25,707
Fuck!

878
01:04:25,708 --> 01:04:28,499
Now the cops will definitely show up!

879
01:04:28,500 --> 01:04:31,082
Wrong. We'll be cut off from the outside.

880
01:04:31,083 --> 01:04:34,457
They will cover this up
to hide the drug business here.

881
01:04:34,458 --> 01:04:35,750
His aura was brown.

882
01:04:36,833 --> 01:04:37,749
What?

883
01:04:37,750 --> 01:04:41,290
Novi's aura before he died.
Dark brown. Not red.

884
01:04:41,291 --> 01:04:42,790
What does that mean?

885
01:04:42,791 --> 01:04:46,165
People with dark brown auras,
that's below blood red.

886
01:04:46,166 --> 01:04:48,082
It wasn't anger.
More like boiling frustration.

887
01:04:48,083 --> 01:04:51,833
Wait, so the aura doesn't have to be red
for someone to die?

888
01:04:52,750 --> 01:04:53,665
No.

889
01:04:53,666 --> 01:04:55,624
Even if everyone stays positive,

890
01:04:55,625 --> 01:04:57,499
there'll always be
the least positive person.

891
01:04:57,500 --> 01:04:58,707
And that person's gonna die.

892
01:04:58,708 --> 01:04:59,707
Fuck.

893
01:04:59,708 --> 01:05:03,791
In the end, we're all
going to die one by one.

894
01:05:06,958 --> 01:05:09,208
I can see everyone's aura,
except for one person.

895
01:05:09,625 --> 01:05:10,708
Who?

896
01:05:15,708 --> 01:05:17,624
Tell us what you know about all this!

897
01:05:17,625 --> 01:05:18,624
Talk!

898
01:05:18,625 --> 01:05:20,000
I swear I don't know anything!

899
01:05:20,875 --> 01:05:22,624
This started happening
when you came in here!

900
01:05:22,625 --> 01:05:24,749
Your boss died the same way?
Like the inmates here?

901
01:05:24,750 --> 01:05:27,290
Yes, but I don't know why. I swear!

902
01:05:27,291 --> 01:05:29,207
Since when did this all start?

903
01:05:29,208 --> 01:05:30,958
Since the day my boss died.

904
01:05:31,500 --> 01:05:33,040
Where were you before? Visiting a shaman?

905
01:05:33,041 --> 01:05:35,750
No. Just covering a story
about a forest in Borneo.

906
01:05:36,250 --> 01:05:37,125
What case?

907
01:05:37,666 --> 01:05:41,040
Protected forest cleared for
illegal nickel mining.

908
01:05:41,041 --> 01:05:42,790
Government officials were behind it.

909
01:05:42,791 --> 01:05:44,082
And?

910
01:05:44,083 --> 01:05:45,750
But the strange part is,

911
01:05:47,166 --> 01:05:49,290
dozens of workers died suspiciously.

912
01:05:49,291 --> 01:05:50,249
What were the bodies like?

913
01:05:50,250 --> 01:05:51,249
What do you mean?

914
01:05:51,250 --> 01:05:53,999
How did they die? Stabbed? Shot?

915
01:05:54,000 --> 01:05:55,582
Allah, forgive me.

916
01:05:55,583 --> 01:05:56,957
I don't know who killed them,

917
