but the bodies were carved
and hung in trees.

918
01:05:59,458 --> 01:06:00,957
Like an art installation.

919
01:06:00,958 --> 01:06:03,250
Like sculptures in an exhibit.

920
01:06:03,750 --> 01:06:05,750
Except this was made by
a complete lunatic.

921
