Anything else you remember?

922
01:06:10,000 --> 01:06:10,999
About what?

923
01:06:11,000 --> 01:06:14,625
Anything! Anything that can
help us survive!

924
01:06:15,916 --> 01:06:17,958
That's all, there's nothing else.

925
01:06:18,541 --> 01:06:20,040
Think harder, damn it!

926
01:06:20,041 --> 01:06:21,333
I did!

927
01:06:21,833 --> 01:06:23,457
I've been thinking hard!

928
01:06:23,458 --> 01:06:24,415
Every day!

929
01:06:24,416 --> 01:06:26,708
Wondering how I ended up here!

930
01:06:28,625 --> 01:06:30,165
I think so hard every single day.

931
01:06:30,166 --> 01:06:32,707
I don't know about you guys,

932
01:06:32,708 --> 01:06:34,915
but I've never even gotten into
a shouting match,

933
01:06:34,916 --> 01:06:36,624
let alone a physical fight,

934
01:06:36,625 --> 01:06:38,500
let alone killed someone!

935
01:06:39,083 --> 01:06:42,333
My little brothers are
still in junior high.

936
01:06:43,208 --> 01:06:47,458
When they were babies,
our parents drowned in a flood.

937
01:06:48,166 --> 01:06:50,875
I don't know how they're doing now.

938
01:06:53,750 --> 01:06:55,958
I always think hard. I swear.

939
01:07:01,666 --> 01:07:04,000
I also think about my purpose in life.

940
01:07:05,500 --> 01:07:07,333
My dad was a shaman.

941
