He said he could heal people.

942
01:07:10,208 --> 01:07:13,833
I didn't believe him.
I thought he was a fraud.

943
01:07:14,708 --> 01:07:17,583
He said I was special.

944
01:07:18,916 --> 01:07:20,458
That I had a special gift.

945
01:07:23,166 --> 01:07:27,000
Now that I'm seeing things like this,

946
01:07:28,083 --> 01:07:31,833
I'm also thinking hard about
what this gift is for.

947
01:07:39,458 --> 01:07:42,541
We're all born with a purpose.

948
01:07:45,250 --> 01:07:52,790
Everything in nature has a "telos,"
a natural end or goal.

949
01:07:52,791 --> 01:07:54,499
That's from Aristotle.

950
01:07:54,500 --> 01:08:02,999
Every individual has a unique and personal
calling or a mission,

951
01:08:03,000 --> 01:08:06,582
and that's from Søren Kierkegaard.

952
01:08:06,583 --> 01:08:08,249
