954
01:08:11,500 --> 01:08:12,833
Less threatening.

955
01:08:14,333 --> 01:08:17,499
We have to have a purpose in this country.

956
01:08:17,500 --> 01:08:20,499
Otherwise, what's the point of life?

957
01:08:20,500 --> 01:08:27,165
So all of us should survive, go out,
and find our purpose.

958
01:08:27,166 --> 01:08:30,874
For that, we have to work together
and find a solution.

959
01:08:30,875 --> 01:08:31,957
Okay?!

960
01:08:31,958 --> 01:08:33,874
Okay.

961
01:08:33,875 --> 01:08:35,208
Okay!
- Okay.

962
01:08:38,041 --> 01:08:39,624
What an eyesore.

963
01:08:39,625 --> 01:08:40,708
Fuck my goat!

964
01:08:44,750 --> 01:08:47,374
After you got back from Borneo,

965
01:08:47,375 --> 01:08:48,958
