1011
01:12:35,791 --> 01:12:38,415
Our Father who art in Heaven,
hallowed be Thy name.

1012
01:12:38,416 --> 01:12:43,082
Thy Kingdom come, Thy will be done
on earth as it is in Heaven.

1013
01:12:43,083 --> 01:12:46,375
Give us this day our daily bread
and forgive us our trespasses as we...

1014
01:12:47,125 --> 01:12:47,916
Bimo!

1015
01:12:49,000 --> 01:12:50,999
He's safe!

1016
01:12:51,000 --> 01:12:52,415
You're safe!
- I'm safe?

1017
01:12:52,416 --> 01:12:53,708
You're safe, Bimo!

1018
01:13:06,833 --> 01:13:07,791
Hey!

1019
01:13:15,375 --> 01:13:17,415
Listen up, all of you.

1020
01:13:17,416 --> 01:13:21,958
We may be enemies. Rivals.

1021
01:13:22,375 --> 01:13:28,375
But when we're in danger,
we must stand together.

1022
01:13:28,916 --> 01:13:32,041
That's the only way we all survive.

1023
01:13:33,166 --> 01:13:34,208
After he's gone,

1024
01:13:36,458 --> 01:13:39,875
