1026
01:14:02,541 --> 01:14:06,415
You think the ghost will just disappear
if Dimas dies? No!

1027
01:14:06,416 --> 01:14:11,207
This isn't a regular ghost.
You can't just get rid of it.

1028
01:14:11,208 --> 01:14:13,999
If he dies, it'll just move on
to the next host.

1029
01:14:14,000 --> 01:14:16,125
And we don't know who.

1030
01:14:17,250 --> 01:14:19,666
We can't fight something
we don't understand.

1031
01:14:20,416 --> 01:14:22,624
