how to stop it.

1034
01:14:27,666 --> 01:14:31,208
If he dies? We have no answers.

1035
01:14:31,958 --> 01:14:34,499
We just wait for our turn to die,
one by one.

1036
01:14:34,500 --> 01:14:35,541
Is that what you want?

1037
01:14:37,208 --> 01:14:38,790
I mean, look at him.

1038
01:14:38,791 --> 01:14:40,083
He's a wimp.

1039
01:14:40,875 --> 01:14:43,082
But look how deadly the ghost is.

1040
01:14:43,083 --> 01:14:45,665
What if it attaches to someone brutal?

1041
01:14:45,666 --> 01:14:47,916
It might kill all of us in one go.

1042
01:14:49,041 --> 01:14:50,125
That's why

1043
01:14:51,125 --> 01:14:53,083
Dimas must not die!

1044
01:14:53,541 --> 01:14:55,291
He's the key!

1045
01:15:04,250 --> 01:15:06,540
I'm the key!

1046
01:15:06,541 --> 01:15:09,041
I shouldn't die!

1047
01:16:02,958 --> 01:16:04,500
I don't understand

1048
01:16:05,791 --> 01:16:13,375
why stupid people make their lives
harder than they need to be.

1049
01:16:14,291 --> 01:16:20,416
Look at the result of teaching you peace.

1050
01:16:20,958 --> 01:16:23,540
Are you all allergic to peace?

1051
01:16:23,541 --> 01:16:25,750
I know who's gonna die next.

1052
01:16:28,500 --> 01:16:29,458
You.

1053
01:16:30,708 --> 01:16:34,874
You have masochistic personality disorder.

1054
01:16:34,875 --> 01:16:38,291
You're dumb, so you don't know
what that means.

1055
01:16:38,833 --> 01:16:40,624
It means

1056
01:16:40,625 --> 01:16:48,707
a person who always seeks
