with a life cursed by millions?</i>

1305
01:34:30,083 --> 01:34:31,125
Shut up!

1306
01:34:32,166 --> 01:34:34,707
I have everything I ever wanted!

1307
01:34:34,708 --> 01:34:36,332
<i>Everything?</i>

1308
01:34:36,333 --> 01:34:38,041
<i>A comfy chair in prison?</i>

1309
01:34:38,583 --> 01:34:40,915
<i>A fancy dining table that means nothing?</i>

1310
01:34:40,916 --> 01:34:44,041
<i>The spoiled kids we used to despise?</i>

1311
01:34:44,458 --> 01:34:47,791
<i>Prakasa, we are outcasts.</i>

1312
01:34:48,500 --> 01:34:50,250
<i>Was this our dream?</i>

1313
01:34:50,666 --> 01:34:52,665
<i>To become thieves in suits?</i>

1314
01:34:52,666 --> 01:34:54,541
I'm not a thief!

1315
01:34:55,625 --> 01:34:59,207
I fought for all of this!

1316
01:34:59,208 --> 01:35:00,958
<i>Fought?</i>

1317
01:35:04,625 --> 01:35:08,541
<i>I remember what we once told Mom.</i>

1318
01:35:09,250 --> 01:35:14,082
<i>"Mom, I want to be someone great.
Someone honorable."</i>

1319
01:35:14,083 --> 01:35:17,332
<i>"I want to make this country better."</i>

1320
01:35:17,333 --> 01:35:19,332
<i>Do we still believe that?</i>

1321
01:35:19,333 --> 01:35:22,499
<i>Or was it all just to make her happy</i>

1322
01:35:22,500 --> 01:35:27,750
<i>before we started stealing
from the people?</i>

1323
01:35:28,916 --> 01:35:31,290
<i>She's gone now, Prakasa.</i>
- Shut up.

1324
01:35:31,291 --> 01:35:35,624
<i>If she were still here, wouldn't she cry
seeing what we've become?</i>

1325
01:35:35,625 --> 01:35:38,375
Shut up! Bastard!

1326
01:37:05,333 --> 01:37:06,625
He's dead!

1327
01:37:14,000 --> 01:37:16,750
Prakasa is dead!

1328
01:37:19,583 --> 01:37:21,375
What else are you fighting for?

1329
01:37:36,166 --> 01:37:37,458
The ghost is gone.

1330
01:37:52,916 --> 01:37:53,916
Stop!

1331
01:38:00,208 --> 01:38:02,624
Traitor! Snitch!

1332
01:38:02,625 --> 01:38:05,165
Snitches don't deserve to live!
You will all die!

1333
01:38:05,166 --> 01:38:08,832
But first, you're going to watch
your friends burn!

1334
01:38:08,833 --> 01:38:11,375
And it's all your fault!

1335
01:38:26,583 --> 01:38:27,957
Water!

1336
01:38:27,958 --> 01:38:31,540
You bastards!

1337
01:38:31,541 --> 01:38:34,083
Why did you use water?!

1338
01:38:35,958 --> 01:38:42,332
Let me go, you bastards!
I'm the Head Warden!

1339
01:38:42,333 --> 01:38:46,332
Only five honest guards out of fifty?

1340
01:38:46,333 --> 01:38:49,333
Ten percent of Indonesia is
still some kind of hope, sir.

1341
01:38:54,750 --> 01:38:58,333
This is about the time
police sirens start kicking in.

1342
01:38:59,750 --> 01:39:01,375
But what for?

1343
01:39:13,125 --> 01:39:15,791
SIX MONTHS LATER

1344
01:39:17,416 --> 01:39:21,250
The pawn must be sacrificed,
just like the people.

1345
01:39:21,625 --> 01:39:22,499
Right.

1346
01:39:22,500 --> 01:39:23,583
So frustrating.

1347
01:39:24,750 --> 01:39:26,249
But a pawn can become something more.

1348
01:39:26,250 --> 01:39:31,415
If it makes it all the way to the end,
toward its dream, it can become the queen.

1349
01:39:31,416 --> 01:39:32,874
There you go.

1350
01:39:32,875 --> 01:39:34,207
So chess is like life?

1351
01:39:34,208 --> 01:39:37,124
That's right.
- Yes!

1352
01:39:37,125 --> 01:39:38,666
I came to say goodbye.

1353
01:39:39,916 --> 01:39:41,624
He is finally free.

1354
01:39:41,625 --> 01:39:46,082
It's rare for an appeal to get
a final verdict this quickly.

1355
01:39:46,083 --> 01:39:47,915
The CCTV footage was pretty clear.

1356
01:39:47,916 --> 01:39:50,957
I wasn't even in my boss's office
when he got murdered.

1357
01:39:50,958 --> 01:39:54,249
It's weird that the footage
was missing back then.

1358
01:39:54,250 --> 01:39:57,207
It's CCTV. It only exists
when it's needed.

1359
01:39:57,208 --> 01:39:58,249
Right.

1360
01:39:58,250 --> 01:39:59,999
And you even got a taste of life in here.

1361
01:40:00,000 --> 01:40:00,916
That's right.

1362
01:40:02,125 --> 01:40:04,207
If you ever miss it, just come back in.

1363
01:40:04,208 --> 01:40:05,540
Yes.

1364
01:40:05,541 --> 01:40:07,916
Now, I see why that ghost clung to you.

1365
01:40:08,666 --> 01:40:10,500
You've got the most positive aura.

1366
01:40:10,916 --> 01:40:11,915
Golden.

1367
01:40:11,916 --> 01:40:12,790
What does it mean?

1368
01:40:12,791 --> 01:40:15,541
Inner peace. Super rare.

1369
01:40:17,750 --> 01:40:20,500
Well, I don't find myself
that peaceful inside.

1370
01:40:20,958 --> 01:40:23,707
Where are you heading after this?

1371
01:40:23,708 --> 01:40:26,375
Borneo, back to Nehea Forest.

1372
01:40:27,166 --> 01:40:31,375
Maybe the ghost's still with me,
so I can take it home.

1373
01:40:31,958 --> 01:40:33,750
Such a good kid.
- Good.

1374
01:40:37,333 --> 01:40:38,833
Group hug!

1375
01:40:42,166 --> 01:40:43,208
Be safe out there.

1376
01:40:44,458 --> 01:40:46,540
Oh, yeah, you're getting out
next month, right?

1377
01:40:46,541 --> 01:40:48,582
If they don't extend my sentence.

1378
01:40:48,583 --> 01:40:49,957
But do you want to get out?

1379
01:40:49,958 --> 01:40:51,541
Of course I do.

1380
01:40:52,125 --> 01:40:53,207
See you outside, then.

1381
01:40:53,208 --> 01:40:54,166
See you.

1382
01:40:57,875 --> 01:40:59,666
It's okay to cry if you want to.

1383
01:41:03,250 --> 01:41:04,375
Take care.

1384
01:41:04,916 --> 01:41:06,583
Be kind, but don't be stupid!

1385
01:41:08,875 --> 01:41:09,625
Kiddo.

1386
01:41:10,333 --> 01:41:11,207
One got out.

1387
01:41:11,208 --> 01:41:12,791
One got out.
- It's about time.

1388
01:41:13,500 --> 01:41:14,999
Come on.

1389
01:41:15,000 --> 01:41:16,665
You okay if I change your name?

1390
01:41:16,666 --> 01:41:18,915
It's okay. We're roommates now.

1391
01:41:18,916 --> 01:41:20,332
What?
- His name.

1392
01:41:20,333 --> 01:41:22,499
But I'm still uncircumcised.
- Relax.

1393
01:41:22,500 --> 01:41:24,375
Still uncircumcised.
- Let me change the name too.

1394
01:41:25,333 --> 01:41:26,749
Listen.

1395
01:41:26,750 --> 01:41:28,625
An Arabic name.

1396
01:41:50,083 --> 01:41:51,875
KEEP THE PEACE TOGETHER

1397
01:43:22,125 --> 01:43:23,040
Action!

1398
01:43:23,041 --> 01:43:23,874
I can't dance.

1399
01:43:23,875 --> 01:43:25,665
Everybody can dance.

1400
01:43:25,666 --> 01:43:26,499
Action!

1401
01:43:26,500 --> 01:43:27,290
I can't dance.

1402
01:43:27,291 --> 01:43:28,874
Everybody can dance.

1403
01:43:28,875 --> 01:43:29,665
Action!

1404
01:43:29,666 --> 01:43:30,791
What?

1405
01:43:45,666 --> 01:43:47,833
Come on.

1406
01:44:04,916 --> 01:44:10,500
Everybody, quick, join the dance.

1407
01:44:12,958 --> 01:44:17,208
Come on.

1408
01:44:18,583 --> 01:44:24,499
Put your hands up. Go big.

1409
01:44:24,500 --> 01:44:31,541
Go big. Go down. Hey!
